This software is modified office applications that are based on Euro-Office, itself based on the original ONLYOFFICE work. Modified versions must preserve notices sufficient to allow users to identify the original developer and the source of the original work.

Office apps with versions < 9 are based on OnlyOffice, versions >= 9 are based on Euro-Office

